# Agent context & safety

Read `@AGENTS.md` and `@AGENTS.agents.md`. This is a static SolidJS/Vite site, not a Go modulith.

- No bulk reads of node_modules/ or dist/; targeted diagnosis reads are allowed.
- Indexing ignore lists are noise control only, not read limits.
- Cloudflare Pages deploys are human-managed; no implicit deployment authority.
- Never merge to main unless a human explicitly asks.
